## The 24 Easy Nail Designs

Think of every design below as a mechanical process, not art. Art requires interpretation. A process requires only following steps in order. That is all this is.

### Group A: No-Tool Designs (Toothpick or Bobby Pin Only)

The six designs below require nothing from your kitchen except a single toothpick. All six are also genuinely suitable for your non-dominant hand.

