**Tool substitute:** Toothpick dragged in a single motion from cuticle to tip.

1. Apply base colour to all nails and dry.
2. Load the toothpick tip with stripe colour polish from the bottle.
3. Place the tip near the cuticle of the accent nail and drag in one steady motion to the free edge.
4. Seal all nails with top coat.

