### Group C: Sponge Designs (Makeup Sponge or Kitchen Sponge)

The sponge gradient method works by applying two polish colours side by side on a makeup sponge, then pressing it onto the nail repeatedly. Each press builds density while naturally blending the colours at the centre  no skill required, imperfection is structural to the technique. This group suits shaky hands and short nails equally well.

